# Change Log
Changelog for LaOS project, inspired on: http://keepachangelog.com

## Unreleased
### Changed
- Migrated from the discontinued mbed 2 library to Mbed CE (CMake/Ninja, pyOCD flashing)
  with the RTOS, netsocket Ethernet and the Mbed SD/FAT stack. The old build system
  (mk.sh, gcc4mbed, mbed.patch, vendored SDFileSystem) is gone.
- config.txt is read from the SD card instead of the semihosted /local drive.
  The firmware no longer stops when no debugger is attached.
- The Ethernet MAC address is derived from the LPC1768 serial number.
- The step interrupt runs from TIMER2 instead of mbed::Ticker (about 6 us per step).
- Waiting for the motion queue sleeps instead of busy-waiting.
- Firmware update from the SD card flashes the new image itself (IAP) instead of
  using the mbed USB drive.
### Added
- Headless mode: a config.txt received with TFTP is saved and the board restarts.
- Without a display the serial console acts as display and keypad.
- Step interrupt and heap statistics in the console log.
### Fixed
- TFTP read of files larger than one block, TFTP write of the last block.
- cleandir() no longer deletes config.txt; config.txt is not listed as a job.
- Heap exhaustion after the first job, menu text leaking memory.
- Rebooting forever when sys.nodisplay is 0 and no display is connected.
- iotest ported to Mbed CE (target iotest).

## 2015-04-20 (no binary release)
- added optional wait_us() in stepper.cpp to support slower
  stepper drivers that need a longer pulse and earlier dir signal. 
  Activate by defining dir_us and pulse_us in config.txt

## 2015-03-18 (laoslaser-2015-03-18.bin)
- added python-colorama to README
- updated mbed.patch to match new mbed subrepository
- updated mbed subrepository to latest version

## 2015-02-23 (laoslaser-2015-02-23.bin / laoslaser-23-02-2015.bin)
Also see: 
http://redmine.laoslaser.org/boards/3/topics/765
https://github.com/LaosLaser/Firmware/pull/42
### Added
- Boundaries ("BOUNDARIES" in menu)
- Lasertest ("LASER TEST" in menu)
- Make current position the origin functionality ("ORIGIN" in menu)
- Machine boundaries limit checking
### Fixed
- Incorrect path for netmask (issue #44)

## 2014-11-14 (laoslaser-2014-11-14.bin / laoslaser-14-11-2014.bin)
